flowchart TD
    A[Benchmark run starts] --> B{Environment variable<br/>ASSIST_EVAL_ORACLE_DIR set?}
    B -- yes --> R[Use the environment-variable location]
    B -- no --> C{Uncommitted local override<br/>sets a location?}
    C -- yes --> R2[Use the override location]
    C -- no --> D[Committed oracleLocation is a<br/>non-sensitive placeholder, no real path]
    D --> E[No usable oracle location resolved]
    E --> F[Report error, score nothing,<br/>name that the location is unset]
    R --> G{Location reachable?}
    R2 --> G
    G -- no --> U[Report error, score nothing,<br/>name the unreachable location]
    G -- yes --> H[Read reference and hidden suite at run time]
    H --> I[Prepare agent workspace with the oracle withheld]
    I --> J[Leak-check the workspace, abort and name a leaked path]
